# Case studies lived at /work/<app> until 2026-09-24, after the site was
# indexed. Keep these for old links and search results.
#
# Target the trailing-slash URL directly: /apps/<app> would 308 to
# /apps/<app>/, a second hop. A placeholder matches one segment, so the
# slashed and bare forms each need a line. First match wins; the splat
# rule catches anything else under /work/ as before.
/work/:app/ /apps/:app/ 301
/work/:app /apps/:app/ 301
/work/* /apps/:splat 301
